WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
These two ideal dipole field lines occupy different depths.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Solid: φ = +60°. Dashed: φ = −60°. Their x,z projections overlap.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
All 3D points stay fixed. The orthographic camera turns by 30°.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The dashed curve is edge-on. Neither the curves nor the field changed.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Prediction: turn the camera back. Will the outlines overlap again?
